      "title": "About",
      "slug": "about",
      "html": "<p>Hey, I'm Rahul. I grew up in Bombay, moved to the United States in my early 20s, and have spent the past 15 years in Detroit. </p><p>I spend a lot of time thinking about gathering, scenes, technology, creative output, and a life well lived. In late 2022 I started a dinner pop-up series called Detroit Dinner Club with a few friends. </p><p>When I'm not playing in the kitchen and thinking about the menu for the next pop-up, my day job involves working at the consulting firm <a href=\"https://www.slalom.com/?ref=rahulshankar.com\">Slalom</a>. I try to study how the world, and the best-performing companies and people operate. I use what I learn to help companies design better systems, products, and ways of working. </p><p>You can find me on <a href=\"twitter.com/rahshank\">Twitter</a> or <a href=\"instagram.com/rahshank\">Instagram</a>.</p><figure class=\"kg-card kg-gallery-card kg-width-wide\"><div class=\"kg-gallery-container\"><div class=\"kg-gallery-row\"><div class=\"kg-gallery-image\"><img src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/2021/05/strawberry-gin-basil-smash.jpg\" width=\"1125\" height=\"2000\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/size/w600/2021/05/strawberry-gin-basil-smash.jpg 600w, https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/size/w1000/2021/05/strawberry-gin-basil-smash.jpg 1000w, https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/2021/05/strawberry-gin-basil-smash.jpg 1125w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 720px) 720px\"></div><div class=\"kg-gallery-image\"><img src=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/2021/05/36daysoftype.jpg\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1124\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://storage.ghost.io/c/e2/8a/e28a1e14-61d2-4410-a50b-7dff6b3f0950/content/images/size/w600/2021/0